https://github.com/tessera-io/platform/pull/527

dedupes late-lot alerts per (plant, line, station) within a 10 min sliding window. first alert goes out, repeats get folded into it with a count. window is a config knob, default 600s. tests cover the boundary + the midnight rollover thing that bit us in jan.

small pr, ~180 lines. lmk

